Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 16:54:57 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Neko LineageOS: [ASTER] add offline KernelSU verification and
 refine status UI

Add an offline verification entry alongside online verification in the
KernelSU dialog. Reuse the existing source-job progress and result
presentation, and disable online verification when no Release root is
configured.

Present module choices when the running kernel KMI cannot be resolved.
Allow the user to reopen an outstanding selection after dismissing the
dialog or returning to the page, while retaining automatic selection
for a unique matching KMI.

Place Cancel first without changing its appearance. Render both
verification actions as text buttons with consistent styling.

